# Firebase — per-tenant, pulled from Firebase Console, never committed.
# The app.json references ./google-services.json and expo prebuild copies
# it into android/app/. To bootstrap: download from Firebase Console →
# Project settings → Your apps → rs.uril.deco.client → google-services.json.
/google-services.json
/GoogleService-Info.plist

.claude/
